<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { padding: 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome, {{name}}!</h2>
        <p>Thank you for registering with the Student Management System. We're excited to have you on board.</p>
        <p>You can log in to your dashboard here:</p>
        <p><a href="{{frontendUrl}}/login" class="btn">Login to Dashboard</a></p>
        <br/>
        <p>Best regards,<br/>The SMS Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
